# ── Databases & dumps (real PII lives here — never commit) ─────────────────
/database/*.sqlite
/database/*.sqlite-journal
/database/dumps/
*.sql.gz
*.dump

# ── Letterheads / signatures (uploaded at runtime, contain real assets) ────
/storage/app/letterheads/

# ── Generated TypeScript types are committed (single source of truth);
